Rock Paper Pencil is compatible with most iPads, with a list <a href="https://shop.astropad.com/collections/shop-astropad/products/rock-paper-pencil">available on the website</a>. The tips work with all &zwnj;Apple Pencil&zwnj; models, including the &zwnj;Apple Pencil&zwnj; Pro.<br/>
